# Copy to app/.env.local for development (never commit .env.local).
# "Mit Google anmelden" in the browser: OAuth web client ID (docs/GOOGLE-LOGIN.md).
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=1234567890-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com
# Desktop app (tauri dev / build): the "Desktop" OAuth client ID. Public, the secret stays on the server.
# VITE_GOOGLE_DESKTOP_CLIENT_ID=1234567890-def.apps.googleusercontent.com
